<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures settle flat in light trade.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures settle flat in light trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney wheat futures showed no change in light trading of the nearby January contract.</p>
<p>January wheat was marked at A$160.00 a tonne on volume of 24 trades and open interest for 625 tonnes.</p>
<p>Traders said bearish sentiment in the United States overnight, where CBOT wheat closed one to 5-3/4 U.S. cents a bushel lower, left the local market relatively lifeless.</p>
